Package: fitdistcp
Title: Calibrating Prior Prediction for Distributions (Rust Port)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("fitdistcp", "authors", email = "noreply@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Rust-backed implementation of calibrating prior prediction (CP)
    for a representative set of distributions, exposed to R via extendr.
    Provides the reference d/p/q/r + t***_cp API for the ten Phase-1 models
    (norm, norm_p1, genextreme, genextreme_p1, genpareto, gumbel, lnorm,
    weibull, gamma, expon), returning the reference field names (ml_pdf,
    cp_pdf, ml_quantiles, cp_quantiles, ml_params, AIC/MAIC, standard errors,
    convergence, and the small-n flag).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.85)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
